(7108661, 1084259, 85102, '<td valign="top">The angle of this shot works very well and I love the lighting. I would have maybe included a bit more of the steering wheel to give more context and go along with the title. Otherwise, great work!</td>', 'The angle of this shot works very well and I love the lighting. I would have maybe included a bit more of the steering wheel to give more context and go along with the title. Otherwise, great work!', '2013-09-30 04:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
