(7108667, 1084385, 85102, '<td valign="top">Well framed, well captured. I would wish for just a bit less post-processing to avoid the over-sharpness I detect (esp. around edges of the man on the right), but that is perhaps just my preference. Really well done otherwise. Feels very natural :)</td>', 'Well framed, well captured. I would wish for just a bit less post-processing to avoid the over-sharpness I detect (esp. around edges of the man on the right), but that is perhaps just my preference. Really well done otherwise. Feels very natural :)', '2013-09-30 04:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
