(7108970, 1084480, 96751, '<td valign="top">I feel the content of this image is above average, but that the editing undercuts it. I don''t like the greenish/bluish tint to his face, especially next to the overly orange mask with green teeth.</td>', 'I feel the content of this image is above average, but that the editing undercuts it. I don''t like the greenish/bluish tint to his face, especially next to the overly orange mask with green teeth.', '2013-09-30 22:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
