(7111469, 1084426, 37999, '<td valign="top">I like this image, however there is a DOF issue going on here. Her glasses are nice and crisp while the rest of her is slowly loosing focus due to DOF. I think I would have rated this higher if at least her smile, face and some of her hair were in focus. After all it is a ''smile'' contest, not a sun glasses contest.</td>', 'I like this image, however there is a DOF issue going on here. Her glasses are nice and crisp while the rest of her is slowly loosing focus due to DOF. I think I would have rated this higher if at least her smile, face and some of her hair were in focus. After all it is a ''smile'' contest, not a sun glasses contest.', '2013-10-05 13:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7111477, 1084004, 37999, '<td valign="top">All I have to say is very beautiful. She has that sparkle in her eye, a good DOF, and awesome cropping. One of my top! Awesome!!</td>', 'All I have to say is very beautiful. She has that sparkle in her eye, a good DOF, and awesome cropping. One of my top! Awesome!!', '2013-10-05 13:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7111482, 1084515, 37999, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites. She has that sparkle in her eyes, her skin looks flawless, and she has that small non exaggerated smile. Her hair also turned out nicely which could have gone so wrong in lighting but you did awesome! The only draw back is it looks like her left eye is falling victim to DOF slightly. For that reason I''m not a 10 but pretty close. Awesome!</td>', 'One of my favorites. She has that sparkle in her eyes, her skin looks flawless, and she has that small non exaggerated smile. Her hair also turned out nicely which could have gone so wrong in lighting but you did awesome! The only draw back is it looks like her left eye is falling victim to DOF slightly. For that reason I''m not a 10 but pretty close. Awesome!', '2013-10-05 13:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7111508, 1084508, 16106, '<td valign="top">I wish the DOF was just a bit wider. It is a lovely shot but the focus pulls attention to the glasses and the eyes, while the mouth is just a bit fuzzy, so it is a better shot tit may get credit for in this challenge. If you had been another stop or two open, it would certainly have ribboned.</td>', 'I wish the DOF was just a bit wider. It is a lovely shot but the focus pulls attention to the glasses and the eyes, while the mouth is just a bit fuzzy, so it is a better shot tit may get credit for in this challenge. If you had been another stop or two open, it would certainly have ribboned.', '2013-10-05 14:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7111522, 1084288, 16106, '<td valign="top">This shot is everything I was looking for in an entry and more. Sadly the coffee cup is the more, and it steals so much of the thunder here. Had it only been a touch lower it would have been a great shot, but it is such a strong element that is saps a great shot. Everything else from the subject to the lighting to the editing is perfect.</td>', 'This shot is everything I was looking for in an entry and more. Sadly the coffee cup is the more, and it steals so much of the thunder here. Had it only been a touch lower it would have been a great shot, but it is such a strong element that is saps a great shot. Everything else from the subject to the lighting to the editing is perfect.', '2013-10-05 14:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
