(7112034, 1084446, 37999, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice smile photo. Kind of classic in a portrait feeling, but there is something about his face that I just can''t look away from. But it is very grey overall is my only negative. Nice!</td>', 'This is a very nice smile photo. Kind of classic in a portrait feeling, but there is something about his face that I just can''t look away from. But it is very grey overall is my only negative. Nice!', '2013-10-07 00:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
