(7112256, 1084445, 60173, '<td valign="top">This is a prime example of why I dig a few pages deep into challenge results. What happened here? Must be that voters were looking for a bigger toothy grin. I totally see a smile, and the technicals are spot on. Maybe I''m reading too much into this, but that kid just looks like a happy kid to me. Unless his hair is professionally colored, those streaks are actually from the sun (gasp). That means he''s being a kid and being outside, maybe even spending time in the pool. Sounds like a life worth smiling about to me.</td>', 'This is a prime example of why I dig a few pages deep into challenge results. What happened here? Must be that voters were looking for a bigger toothy grin. I totally see a smile, and the technicals are spot on. Maybe I''m reading too much into this, but that kid just looks like a happy kid to me. Unless his hair is professionally colored, those streaks are actually from the sun (gasp). That means he''s being a kid and being outside, maybe even spending time in the pool. Sounds like a life worth smiling about to me.', '2013-10-07 11:32:19.000000', NULL, 0),
